# UI Component Rules

- Prefer using the 31 components in `@app/ui` over raw React Native primitives.
- For form fields, always use the React Hook Form wrappers (`CustomFormInput`, `CustomFormDropdown`, `CustomFormDatePicker`, `CustomFormFilePicker`, `CustomFormSwitch`).
- Access theme colors using `useTheme()` from `react-native-paper`.
- Custom style props must be typed as `StyleProp<ViewStyle>` or `StyleProp<TextStyle>`.
- Typography adheres to the Inter font weights (400 Regular, 500 Medium, 600 SemiBold, 700 Bold).
